# PLAN-927 T-09 — 七 profile 统一源码语法的文件化 parse 面。每个 profile
# 一个冻结源（ace-m1/src 语料字节原样 / 合同内联脚本），经
# `auto-source@<profile>` 的裁剪语法程序解析：completion=success + 无损重建
# oracle（reconstructed.at 与源逐字节相同）。拒绝/诊断保真面（stage/code/
# span/message 逐字节）由固定组 `ace-source-syntax-927`（ace-core conformance
# 差分 harness，567 组合+70 edge）承载——两个 oracle 相互独立（重建=字节
# 事实；差分=冻结预期）。


```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m1.source-syntax-927.core"
  tags: ["ace-m1", "source-syntax", "plan-927"]
  links: ["PLAN-927"]
  source: { file: "oracle/core.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "parse", adapter: "syntax", action: "parse",
      options: { grammar: "auto-source@core" },
      expect: { completion: "success", artifacts: [ { path: "reconstructed.at", file: "oracle/core.at" } ] } },
  ]
}
```

